# 2. pc-live.test.js, product-check-live.e2e.mjs: lines over 200 characters wrapped (format-check). No assertion changed.
# 3. product-check-live.e2e.mjs check "TESTER image mode": the locked version expected an automatic, face-checked JPEG.
